# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions for the latest version of Samplomatic"
msgstr "Instruções de instalação da versão mais recente do Samplomatic"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions"
msgstr "Instruções de instalação"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions {#installation-instructions}"
msgstr "Instruções de instalação {#installation-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Pré-requisitos {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. We recommend using [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Primeiro, crie um ambiente mínimo com apenas o Python instalado. Recomendamos usar [ambientes virtuais Python](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Ative o seu novo ambiente.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two primary ways to install the packages:\n"
msgstr "Há duas formas principais de instalar os pacotes:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Option 1: Install from PyPI](#option-1)\n"
msgstr "[Opção 1: instalar pelo PyPI](#option-1)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Option 2: Install from source](#option-2)\n"
msgstr "[Opção 2: instalar a partir do código-fonte](#option-2)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"option-1\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 1: Install from PyPI {#option-1-install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Opção 1: instalar pelo PyPI {#option-1-install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The most straightforward way to install the `samplomatic` package is via `PyPI`.\n"
msgstr "A forma mais direta de instalar o pacote `samplomatic` é pelo `PyPI`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"option-2\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 2: Install from source {#option-2-install-from-source}"
msgstr "Opção 2: instalar a partir do código-fonte {#option-2-install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you plan to develop in the repository or run the notebooks locally, you should install from source.\n"
msgstr "Se você pretende desenvolver no repositório ou executar os notebooks localmente, deve instalar a partir do código-fonte.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, clone the `samplomatic` repository.\n"
msgstr "Primeiro, clone o repositório `samplomatic`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, upgrade pip and enter the repository.\n"
msgstr "Em seguida, atualize o pip e entre no repositório.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `samplomatic` to the virtual environment. If you plan to run the notebooks and their visualizations, install the notebook dependencies. If you plan on developing in the repository, install the `dev` and `vis` dependencies.\n"
msgstr "O próximo passo é instalar o `samplomatic` no ambiente virtual. Se você pretende executar os notebooks e suas visualizações, instale as dependências dos notebooks. Se você pretende desenvolver no repositório, instale as dependências `dev` e `vis`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the options below to suit your needs.\n"
msgstr "Ajuste as opções abaixo conforme as suas necessidades.\n"
